  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">Every capability is an Action row + Binding row; the Binding is the ONLY routing config surface. NO new AI dispatch endpoint; NO string-key resolution outside the Binding table. Dispatch flows through the shipped session-dispatch seam. Rows are authored mirror-first under infra/dataverse/ THROUGH the core's hoisted description source. Eval cases gate the catalog change (row does not merge without them). OutputSchemaJson MUST pass OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator — property-level boolean `required` is BANNED (use the object-level required array).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">Dispatched output is ledger-written by the seam (storage precedes rendering); the row rides that path, never a parallel cache.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Eval obligation: golden + dispatch families ≥5 each ship with the row (delivered in task 045); no row merges without eval coverage.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Engine frozen — NO new sprk_analysisplaybook records. This is a prompted Action, not a playbook. Consumes the R1 `compose-selection` scope; does not author a new scope.</constraint>
  </constraints>

