  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + gate">Load this task, project CLAUDE.md, the HANDOFF contract doc, Spike-1 note, and knowledge files. CONFIRM core Phase A0 has published the triple-twin description hoist + dispatch/invoke seam before authoring (this task is blocked until then).</step>
    <step order="1" name="Author Action row">Via jps-action-create, author the `compose-explain-clause` Action: plain-language clause-explanation SystemPrompt (adeu behavioral-prompt style), Temperature, ModelDeploymentId, and OutputSchemaJson `{explanation: string, keyConcepts: string[], relatedPlaybookIds: string[]}`. Write the input-schema + output-schema mirrors under infra/dataverse/. Author the description THROUGH the hoisted source.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Author Binding row">Add the Click-path Binding row to infra/dataverse/sprk_playbookconsumer-rows.json (consumerType compose-explain-clause, consumerCode default, surfaces workspace, toolDescription = the LLM/tooltip guidance), consuming `compose-selection`. Name-keyed upsert; the Binding is the sole routing config.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Validate schema">Run jps-validate: OutputSchemaJson passes OpenAiFunctionSchemaValidator; confirm NO property-level boolean `required`; render-test the prompt.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Verify dispatch path">Confirm the Binding resolves through dispatchConsumer → POST /api/ai/chat/sessions/{id}/dispatch → SessionDispatchOrchestrator → GetBindingByIdAsync → prompted executor, adding zero new routes.</step>
  </steps>

